      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-2">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">02 / WORKFLOW</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">
          五步闭环：从一句想法到可验证的分支交付
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted">
          遵循「条条大道通罗马」原则（ADR 0022 &amp; 0025）：不写死僵化流水线，由主管根据任务风险挑选执行方式，并通过事件触发形成完整闭环。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 5-Step Pipeline Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 border-t border-l border-line bg-page">
        {workflowSteps.map((item) => (
          <div class="p-5 border-r border-b border-line flex flex-col justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="space-y-2.5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs">
