              <pre class="p-3 rounded-xs bg-sunken border border-line overflow-x-auto font-mono text-ink"><code>curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XiaoXianThis/Sous/main/work/scripts/install-sous.sh | sh</code></pre>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <div class="text-muted font-medium">Windows PowerShell：</div>
